bibo:shortTitle a owl:AnnotationProperty.
bibo:uri a owl:AnnotationProperty.
bibo:volume a owl:AnnotationProperty.
<http://www.iau.org/static/resolutions/IAU2012_English.pdf> dc:creator ombibo:IAUDiv1WG;
                                                            dc:date "2012";
